			<span>3. Add allowed public keys (npub1... or hex) to the allowlist</span>
			<span>4. Send a DM to the bot's public key from any Nostr client</span>
		</div>
		<div>
			<label class="text-xs text-[var(--muted)] mb-1 block">Account ID</label>
