		</div>
		${
			bootstrapEndpoint &&
			html`<div class="rounded-md border border-[var(--border)] bg-[var(--surface2)] p-2">
			<div class="text-xs text-[var(--muted)] mb-1">Messaging endpoint \u2014 paste this into your bot\u2019s configuration:</div>
